        "official_en_sha256": "5e5e43d07b21c785eac54f6eb467f40aacf591bd065cf7d91a461fadb1f67bf1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あなたたちの飛空艇を攻撃したのも\r\nグランシェルト城に兵を派遣したのも\r\nすべては死体を集めるためです。",
        "official_en": "It took quite the effort, collecting that bunch. We had to destroy your airship and send many of our forces to Grandshelt Castle.",
        "real_en": "The attack on your airship and the soldiers sent to Grandshelt Castle... It was all to collect corpses."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
