      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それでどうでした？\r\nあの死体と戦ってみて。\r\n是非、感想を聞かせてもらいたいのですが。",
        "official_en": "But enough rambling. Tell me, how was it, fighting the dead? I’d love to hear your feedback.",
        "real_en": "So, how was it, fighting those corpses? I'd love to hear what you thought."
