        "official_en_sha256": "c8a5959986ddd1da62a0d1e9108c672cbb0d7fe7c6e8b63580134b1e1b316b22"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "やれやれ。\r\n私は暇人ではありません。\r\nあなたたちの相手は、こいつに任せるとしましょう。",
        "official_en": "My, my, I really am quite swamped at the moment. You’ll have to play with this instead.",
        "real_en": "Good grief. I have better things to do. I'll leave you to this one."
      },
