    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_030_01:030_01_012:6f654749",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_030_01",
        "key": "030_01_012",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_030_01:030_01_012:6f654749",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_030_01:030_01_012:6f654749",
        "jp_sha256": "624955e2325f4261678a808555d93137bed7c70ced2ed053ae94d27605846b51",
        "official_en_sha256": "30869fdf61f441900ded4cea2d544bc3a04c66a9ae71773ee6302701d6ee999f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "何を怒っているのですか？\r\n死体などただの肉塊……。\r\n実験材料にすぎないというのに。",
        "official_en": "Why are you so angry, I wonder? They were nothing but hunks of moving flesh—mere subjects of my experiments.",
        "real_en": "Why are you so angry? Corpses are just lumps of flesh... Nothing more than materials for my experiments."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_030_01",
