        "official_en_sha256": "055a5d94648bec71fc38c04d07fd439f8a7f2aedfd22171855f74a77eb620b75"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "偉大な研究に貢献できるのですから\r\n彼らも本望でしょう。",
        "official_en": "I’m sure they feel great pride in their contribution to scientific advancement.",
        "real_en": "Surely they're pleased to contribute to such great research."
