        "official_en_sha256": "d41b8523643ace7d48d3fe01f946c29f18b54abdd25f0851612ddc8d3c8b9e02"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "六盟傑に協力したのも\r\n死体を自由にしていいという条件が\r\nあってのことですから。",
        "official_en": "My partnership with the Sworn Six was based on that very condition—the freedom to do with the dead as I please.",
        "real_en": null
      },
