        "official_en_sha256": "173c76f60869e17c05c1360800455afa4a5ddbc792ca59c72f7d69a8618acf63"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "外は自然豊かで海も綺麗ですし\r\n研究に没頭するには最高の場所ですよ。",
        "official_en": "The location couldn’t be better, either. Nature thrives in abundance outside, and the ocean is quite beautiful. The perfect place to immerse myself in my work.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
