      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "私の作品と戦ったなら察しはついているでしょう。\r\nここは死者を再利用するための研究所です。",
        "official_en": "Did fighting some of my marvelous creations not make that clear? This is a place of research, dedicated to the reclamation of the dead.",
        "real_en": "If you fought my creations, you must have an idea. This is a laboratory for reusing the dead."
